            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JEANETTE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Liked this recipe. Minor changes, I added the asparagus to last 3 minutes of pasta cooking and used a frozen seafood mixture of scallops, calamari, shrimp and mussels. Tasted very good and easy. Thanks for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2023-05-19T23:23:51.089Z"
